    {
      "title": "Tool Calling Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Tool Calling Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What a Tool Is",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "A ==tool== = a function the model asks for by **name** with JSON arguments",
                "The model {red:never runs} it; ==your code== does",
                "Definition has 3 parts: `name`, `description`, input JSON schema",
                "The `description` is the prompt: it tells the model **when** to use the tool"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. The Round Trip",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Send",
                    "sub": "messages + tools",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Tool call",
                    "sub": "name, id, arguments",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Run",
                    "sub": "your code",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Return",
                    "sub": "result by id",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "API",
                "Wants tools",
                "Final answer"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Anthropic",
                  "`stop_reason: tool_use`",
                  "`end_turn`"
                ],
                [
                  "OpenAI",
                  "`finish_reason: tool_calls`",
                  "`stop`"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "A tool call comes instead of text. Send the result back, then ==repeat until a plain answer==."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Who executes a call?** Your app, never the model",
                "**What does the model output?** A tool call: name, id, JSON arguments",
                "**How do you know it wants a tool?** `tool_use` / `tool_calls`; `end_turn` / `stop` means final"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Defining Tools and JSON Schemas",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Defining Tools and JSON Schemas",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Schema Basics",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Keyword",
                "Constrains"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`type: object`",
                  "top level; fields go in `properties`"
                ],
                [
                  "`required`",
                  "array of mandatory names"
                ],
                [
                  "`type` / `enum`",
                  "value kind / fixed choices"
                ],
                [
                  "`minimum` / `maximum`",
                  "number range"
                ],
                [
                  "`items`",
                  "element schema of an array"
                ],
                [
                  "`description`",
                  "meaning and format"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Steering the Model",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Description: ==what== it does, ==when== to use it, ==when not==, each arg's format",
                "Fixed choices → `enum`; keep params ==flat==",
                "`additionalProperties: false` asks for no extra keys; enforced only with ==strict== tool use"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "json",
              "lines": [
                "{\"name\":\"get_weather\",\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",",
                "\"properties\":{\"location\":{\"type\":\"string\"},",
                "\"unit\":{\"enum\":[\"celsius\",\"fahrenheit\"]}},",
                "\"required\":[\"location\"],",
                "\"additionalProperties\":false}}"
              ],
              "note": "the model's call is below"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "output",
              "lines": [
                "{\"location\":\"Pune\",\"unit\":\"celsius\"}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistakes and Interview Point",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Vague names like `do_action`",
                "Many overlapping tools",
                "Optional fields marked required: model ==invents values=="
              ],
              "style": "cross"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Schema is a hint",
              "text": "Always ==validate== arguments server side."
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Why validate?** The schema only guides the model; check values server side",
                "**Wrong tool?** Sharp descriptions, few distinct tools, narrow schemas",
                "**In a description?** What, when, when not, argument formats"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Tool Call Loop",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "The Tool Call Loop",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The Loop",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Call model",
                    "sub": "messages + tools",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Tool calls?",
                    "sub": "none: final answer",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Run each",
                    "sub": "your code",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Append",
                    "sub": "assistant + results, repeat",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Match each result to its call by ==id== (`tool_use_id` / `tool_call_id`)",
                "Results must follow the assistant message that made the calls",
                "Parallel calls: run them ==concurrently==",
                "Return all results together, each matched by id"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Skeleton and tool_choice",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "for _ in range(max_turns):",
                "    resp = model(messages, tools)",
                "    messages.append(resp.message)",
                "    if not resp.tool_calls: break",
                "    for c in resp.tool_calls:",
                "        messages.append(result(c.id, run(c)))",
                "else: raise RuntimeError('turn cap hit')"
              ],
              "note": "for/else: the cap fails loudly, not silently"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Goal",
                "Anthropic",
                "OpenAI"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Model decides",
                  "`auto`",
                  "`auto`"
                ],
                [
                  "Must call some tool",
                  "`any`",
                  "`required`"
                ],
                [
                  "Must call this tool",
                  "`tool` + name",
                  "named function"
                ],
                [
                  "No tools",
                  "`none`",
                  "`none`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Common Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "No turn cap: runaway loop and cost",
                "Dropped assistant tool-call message",
                "Result with a mismatched id"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Always cap turns",
              "text": "A ==max_turns== cap ends a runaway loop; handle the cap, never hang."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Structured Outputs and Error Handling",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Structured Outputs and Error Handling",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Structured Output",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Method",
                "Guarantee"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Prompt for JSON",
                  "None; may add prose or break syntax"
                ],
                [
                  "Forced tool",
                  "always a tool call; args usually match, guaranteed only with strict mode"
                ],
                [
                  "Schema-constrained output",
                  "Valid JSON in your schema"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Forced tool: input schema = ==your shape==, set `tool_choice`",
                "Still ==validate values==; handle refusal and `max_tokens` truncation"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Tool Errors",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Tool fails",
                    "ink": "red"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Flagged result",
                    "sub": "is_error true",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Model fixes call",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Retry cap, then give up",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "json",
              "lines": [
                "{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"t1\",\"is_error\":true,",
                "\"content\":\"{\\\"error\\\":\\\"unit must be celsius or fahrenheit\\\"}\"}"
              ],
              "note": "short, actionable message"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Raising exceptions that crash the loop",
                "Returning raw stack traces",
                "Retrying forever",
                "Retrying payments or emails without safeguards",
                "No timeouts or permission checks on destructive tools"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Guaranteed JSON?** Schema-constrained output, or a forced strict tool",
                "**Tool fails?** Flagged result, short message",
                "**Side effects?** Retries repeat them; make idempotent or confirm"
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
