            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==MCP== (Model Context Protocol): open standard linking AI apps to tools and data",
                "A **host** app runs several MCP **clients**",
                "Each client connects to ==one== **server**",
                "Messages use ==JSON-RPC 2.0=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
