              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Round trip?** Send tools, get call, run it, return result by id, get answer",
                "**Function calling vs MCP?** Same schemas; MCP standardizes discovery and calls",
                "**Safe agent?** Cap turns, validate, least privilege, timeouts, confirm destructive"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
